window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-41604578f550223e"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"sales\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">销售</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需查看完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。将 <code>.md</code> 附加到页面 URL 后，可查看该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>将客户账户背景和交易信号转化为销售行动。</p> <p>使用 ChatGPT Work 或 Codex 汇总客户账户记录、客户沟通、销售管线信号和未解决的风险。ChatGPT 可以把经过批准的背景资料整理成简报、跟进内容、预测审查和账户计划，并将有来源支持的事实与推断出的机会或风险区分开来。</p> <p><a id=\"prioritize-pipeline-and-forecast\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">安排销售管线和预测的优先级</h2> <p>找出需要优先关注的客户账户，再审查哪些交易应继续计入承诺预测、转入乐观情景，或从预测中剔除。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/prioritize-accounts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">确定客户账户优先级（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供客户账户记录、客户沟通、使用信号、续约或增长……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/forecast-risk-review\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">审查预测风险（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供预测快照、商机记录、通话记录、交易讨论串、电子邮件……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"prepare-and-follow-up-on-meetings\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">准备会议并跟进</h2> <p>先汇总客户会议所需的背景，再把经过批准的笔记或文字稿转化为跟进草稿、内部摘要和便于审阅的后续步骤。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/meeting-prep-briefs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">准备会议简报（本地尚未收录）</a>：将 ChatGPT 与 Calendar、Drive、Slack 和 Gmail 配合使用；先从已批准的来源收集……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/zoom-meeting-follow-ups\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">把会议转化为后续行动（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 ChatGPT 和 Zoom 文字稿及 AI Companion 摘要，起草面向客户的跟进……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"plan-accounts-and-unblock-deals\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">规划客户账户并推动交易</h2> <p>根据近期客户信号更新账户策略，或找出停滞交易的阻碍因素和升级处理路径。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/strategic-account-plan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">更新战略客户账户计划（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供客户账户和商机记录、通话、讨论串、电子邮件、使用情况记录、产品……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/stalled-deal-diagnosis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">诊断停滞的交易（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供阶段历史、已结束的活动、通话文字稿、电子邮件和交易讨论串……</li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"sales\">Sales</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Turn account context and deal signals into pipeline actions.</p> <p>Use ChatGPT Work or Codex to bring together account records, customer conversations, pipeline signals, and open risks. ChatGPT can turn approved context into briefs, follow-ups, forecast reviews, and account plans while keeping sourced facts separate from inferred opportunity or risk.</p> <h2 id=\"prioritize-pipeline-and-forecast\">Prioritize pipeline and forecast</h2> <p>Rank the accounts that need attention, then review which deals should remain in commit, move to upside, or come out of the forecast.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/prioritize-accounts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Prioritize accounts (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT account records, customer conversations, usage signals, renewal or growth...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/forecast-risk-review\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Review forecast risk (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT forecast snapshots, opportunity records, call notes, deal threads, email...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"prepare-and-follow-up-on-meetings\">Prepare and follow up on meetings</h2> <p>Gather the context for a customer meeting, then turn approved notes or a transcript into follow-up drafts, an internal recap, and reviewable next steps.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/meeting-prep-briefs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Prepare meeting briefs (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT with Calendar, Drive, Slack, and Gmail to gather approved sources before a...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/zoom-meeting-follow-ups\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Turn meetings into follow-ups (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT with Zoom transcripts and AI Companion summaries to draft customer follow-up...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"plan-accounts-and-unblock-deals\">Plan accounts and unblock deals</h2> <p>Refresh an account strategy from recent customer signals, or diagnose the blocker and escalation path behind a stalled opportunity.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/strategic-account-plan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Refresh a strategic account plan (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT account and opportunity records, calls, threads, emails, usage notes, product...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/stalled-deal-diagnosis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Diagnose a stalled deal (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT stage history, closed activities, call transcripts, emails, deal threads...</li> </ul>"};
